{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026z2yCvKv0np1795439957.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西九龍碧海藍天分行高級區域經理許永生表示，中原最新促成一宗深水埗AVA228成交，單位為高層A室，實用面積202平方呎，採開放式間隔，單位座向西南方，享單邊開揚市景，最初以320萬元放售，議價後累減18萬元或6%，現以302萬元成交，折合實用呎價14950元。</p><p><br/>中原地產許永生指，原業主於2025年1月以300萬元購入單位，持貨不足2年，是次沽出單位賬面可算平手離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.758220+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:37:33.507459+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:17:18.747894+00:00","content_hash":"26e08f9d718e20fce12ebc8e09cfee2b61db52472ec5cd5336918fcd6dace3e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.758220+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}